        "correct": false,
        "why": "They share one."
      },
      {
        "text": "Reserved processors",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Not what namespaces do."
      },
      {
        "text": "A virtual network card made by QEMU",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "QEMU is not involved."
      }
    ]
  },
